# infra/deployment.env - the ONE and only declaration of the deployment target (D-54; spec 04 A-07).
#
# This is the ONLY place in the repo where the region is declared for execution:
#   * .github/workflows/deploy.yml  (deploy + smoke jobs) and .github/workflows/prune.yml (destroy job)
#     load it at runtime through their `load-deploy-config` step;
#   * docs/specs/04-pipeline/bootstrap-oidc-cli.sh sources this same file (its header literals are
#     only a fallback for CloudShell runs made without the repo checked out).
# scripts/check.ps1 audits the consistency across all of them: the file must exist, every region
# literal in IaC, workflows and the bootstrap script must equal AWS_REGION below, no workflow may
# hand-fix AWS_REGION, and ARTIFACTS_BUCKET must carry the region token. That is what makes
# "deploy in any region" safe: a half-done migration (this file moved, a workflow or the role policy
# left behind) fails the GATE, not a live deploy.
#
# Changing region = edit AWS_REGION + ARTIFACTS_BUCKET here -> re-run bootstrap-oidc-cli.sh so the
# CI role policy is re-emitted with the new region's ARNs (external AWS write: needs its own user
# visto, per-phase rule I6/D-42) -> let the pipeline create the per-region artifacts bucket.
# S3 bucket names are a GLOBAL namespace: a second region can never reuse the first region's
# bucket name, which is why ARTIFACTS_BUCKET carries a region suffix (the unsuffixed name was taken
# by the bucket the first runs of this project created in the legacy region).
#
# This file IS committed deliberately: it contains NAMES ONLY - no credentials, no tokens, no
# secrets of any kind. The app secrets live exclusively in the GitHub `dev` environment
# (spec 04 §5.4) and reach CI only as secrets.* references; the 12-digit AWS account id below is
# not a secret (it ships in every ARN) but it is still declared once, here, for the same audit.
AWS_REGION=eu-west-1
STACK_NAME=subdesk-api-dev
ARTIFACTS_BUCKET=aws-sam-cli-managed-subdesk-api-dev-artifacts-euwest1
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=159177056493
GITHUB_ENVIRONMENT=dev
